{title: O the Deep, Deep Love of Jesus}
{artist: S. Trevor Francis / Thomas J. Williams}
{genre: Hymn}
{style: Anthem}
{flow: Meditative}
{key: Em}
{key_original: Fm}
{tempo: 92}
{time: 4/4}
{score: o-the-deep-deep-love-of-jesus.abc}
{c: Chords checked against the four-part harmony of the Open Hymnal score (O_The_Deep_Deep_Love_Of_Jesus-Ebenezer-Ton_Y_Botel)}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Em]O the__[G]__ [B]deep, [C]deep [Am]love [B7]of [Em]Jesus,
[G]Vast, unmeas__[B7]__[Em]ured, [Am]bound[B7]less, free!
[Em]Rolling__[G]__ [B]as [C]a [Am]might[B7]y [Em]ocean
[G]In its full__[B7]__[Em]ness [Am]ov[B7]er me!
[G]Underneath [D]me, [Em]all around [B]me,
[E]Is the cur[D]rent [Em]of Thy [B]love
[C]Leading [B]on[C]ward, [Am]lead[B7]ing [Em]homeward
[G]To [D7]Thy [G]glor[C]ious [Am]rest [B7]above!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Em]O the__[G]__ [B]deep, [C]deep [Am]love [B7]of [Em]Jesus,
[G]Spread His praise__[B7]__ [Em]from [Am]shore [B7]to shore!
[Em]How He__[G]__ [B]lov[C]eth, [Am]ev[B7]er [Em]loveth,
[G]Changeth ne__[B7]__[Em]ver, [Am]nev[B7]ermore!
[G]How He watch[D]es [Em]o’er His loved [B]ones,
[E]Died to call [D]them [Em]all His [B]own;
[C]How for [B]them [C]He [Am]in[B7]ter[Em]cedeth,
[G]Watch[D7]eth [G]o’er [C]them [Am]from [B7]the throne!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Em]O the__[G]__ [B]deep, [C]deep [Am]love [B7]of [Em]Jesus,
[G]Love of ev__[B7]__[Em]ery [Am]love [B7]the best!
[Em]’Tis an__[G]__ [B]o[C]cean [Am]full [B7]of [Em]blessing,
[G]’Tis a ha__[B7]__[Em]ven [Am]giv[B7]ing rest!
[G]O the deep, [D]deep [Em]love of Je[B]sus,
[E]’Tis a heaven [D]of [Em]heavens to [B]me;
[C]And it [B]lifts [C]me [Am]up [B7]to [Em]glory,
[G]For [D7]it [G]lifts [C]me [Am]up [B7]to Thee!
{end_of_verse}
